cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Pore Segmentation Suite"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, interactive, multi-method tool for pore segmentation and
  colour characterization of natural building stones: 14 segmentation
  algorithms (classical thresholding, blob/region, colour/clustering,
  hybrid, and the SAM 2 / Cellpose foundation models), colour-palette
  extraction, EN 15886 / CIEDE2000 aging analysis with metric-specific
  perceptual thresholds, and a journal-figure collage builder.
